First, let me say how much I welcomed Max's feedback and willingness to
debate topics of interest on the List.  Reading Max's post and re-
reading his Principles I withdraw my criticism's of the use of faith and
evolution within them.  I had read a couple of sentences out of context
and misread a few others.

Second, I think that our interpretations of Smith's book are not as
different as Max seems to think.  Smith does talk about both uses of
